# Support ~/.git-template for normal Git use without applying it to Bazel's
# dependency repositories. The template predefines origin for the tausman* fetch
# rules, which otherwise makes Bazel's `git remote add origin` fail with
# "remote origin already exists". An empty value disables templates only for
# repository rules; existing repositories' fetch settings are unchanged.
common --repo_env=GIT_TEMPLATE_DIR=
